{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03733","headline":"奉和天枢成宴夷夏羣僚应制 · 李峤","name":"奉和天枢成宴夷夏羣僚应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"辙迹光西崦，勳庸纪北燕。\n何如万方会，颂德九门前。\n灼灼临黄道，迢迢入紫烟。\n仙盘正下露，高柱欲承天。\n山类丛云起，珠疑大火悬。\n声流尘作刼，业固海成田。\n帝泽倾尧酒，宸歌掩舜弦。\n欣逢下生日，还覩上皇年。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李峤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03733.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03733","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}